parallel_state.py: add RankParallelismConfig and ParallelismContext, which
allow creating a model shard with an explicit parallelism config outside a
real distributed environment.

model_loader/parameter_mapper.py: add ParameterMapper, which maps HuggingFace
checkpoint weight names to sglang parameters (stacked-parameter fusion, MoE
expert sharding, and quantization scale remapping).

